  "reasoning": "The defendant, a government official, accepted large sums of money and valuables in exchange for using his official position – this constitutes bribery (受贿). He also diverted public funds from a state‑owned enterprise to a private individual without proper authorization, which is the crime of misappropriating public funds (挪用公款). Additionally, his personal assets far exceed his lawful income and a portion cannot be explained, indicating embezzlement of state assets (贪污). Therefore the appropriate charges are bribery, misappropriation of public funds, and embezzlement.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]受贿;挪用公款;贪污<eoa>"
